{"path":"index.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Holistic & Integrative Care</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Whole-person care to help you feel steadier, calmer, and more energized — educational, evidence-minded, and individualized.">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/styles.css">
</head>
<body class="aura">
  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="wrap">
      <a class="brand" href="/">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</a>
      <nav class="main-nav" id="mainNav">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <a href="/conditions.html">What We Treat</a>
        <a href="/approach.html">How We Work</a>
        <a href="/pricing.html">Packages</a>
        <a href="/about.html">About & Team</a>
        <a class="cta" href="/book.html">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
      </nav>
      <button id="navToggle" class="nav-toggle" aria-label="Toggle navigation">☰</button>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <!-- HERO -->
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="wrap hero-grid">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <h1>Integrative care that listens — your life, your rhythm.</h1>
          <p class="lead">At {{BUSINESS_NAME}}, we blend nutrition, lifestyle, mind-body strategies, and selective testing to build a personalized plan that supports lasting balance. No promises — just thoughtful, whole-person care.</p>
          <p class="meta">{{TAGLINE}}</p>
          <div class="hero-ctas">
            <a class="btn primary" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
            <a class="btn ghost" href="/about.html">Meet {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-visual" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 600 400" class="hero-blob">
            <defs>
              <linearGradient id="g1" x1="0" x2="1">
                <stop offset="0" stop-color="#9be7c4" />
                <stop offset="1" stop-color="#7bd3ff" />
              </linearGradient>
            </defs>
            <path d="M70,200 C120,100 220,60 320,90 C420,120 520,160 530,250 C540,340 420,360 320,360 C220,360 90,300 70,200 Z" fill="url(#g1)" opacity="0.95"></path>
          </svg>
          <div class="hero-card">
            <h3>Intensive Foundations Program</h3>
            <p>6-week focused intake for a clear plan, labs as needed, and weekly check-ins to build momentum.</p>
            <a class="btn small" href="/pricing.html">Explore Plans</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <svg class="pattern" aria-hidden="true"><use href="assets/img/pattern.svg#tile"/></svg>
    </section>

    <!-- STORY -->
    <section class="story wrap">
      <div class="story-inner">
        <h2>Why holistic care now?</h2>
        <p>Modern stressors unsettle many systems at once. Our practice considers digestion, sleep, movement, stress, and relationships as connected threads. We educate, collaborate, and support — you stay the expert of your life while we bring tools and context.</p>
        <ul class="bullets">
          <li><strong>Evidence-minded:</strong> we lean on research where it helps.</li>
          <li><strong>Individualized:</strong> plans shaped by your history, values, and goals.</li>
          <li><strong>Practical:</strong> small, high-impact changes to build sustainable routines.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- FRAMEWORK -->
    <section class="framework">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2>Our four-part approach</h2>
        <div class="grid framework-grid">
          <div class="card">
            <h3>Intake & Listening</h3>
            <p>We begin with a thoughtful intake to understand symptoms, lifestyle, and priorities.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <h3>Personalized Plan</h3>
            <p>Nutrition, sleep hygiene, movement, and targeted supplements when appropriate — explained clearly so you can implement them.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <h3>Optional Labs & Education</h3>
            <p>Lab testing is presented as an educational tool — optional, explained, and never pushed. It helps refine the plan when indicated.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <h3>Follow-up & Adjustment</h3>
            <p>Regular check-ins keep things realistic and adaptable. We emphasize small wins and iterative progress.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- OFFERS -->
    <section class="offers wrap" id="offers">
      <h2>Programs & Intensives</h2>
      <p class="intro">Pick a path that fits your time and needs. Each includes educational materials and a roadmap — nothing guaranteed; outcomes vary by person.</p>
      <div class="grid offers-grid">
        <div class="offer">
          <h3>Foundations Intensive</h3>
          <p>6 weeks — initial intake, 4 coaching sessions, targeted labs as discussed, email support.</p>
          <a class="btn" href="/pricing.html">See Pricing</a>
        </div>
        <div class="offer highlight">
          <h3>Deep Reset</h3>
          <p>12 weeks — for people wanting a guided, immersive reset with weekly calls and stepwise goals.</p>
          <a class="btn" href="/pricing.html">Learn More</a>
        </div>
        <div class="offer">
          <h3>Monthly Maintenance</h3>
          <p>Ongoing coaching and adjustments for steady progress after an intensive.</p>
          <a class="btn" href="/pricing.html">Details</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- PRICING (brief preview) -->
    <section class="pricing-preview wrap">
      <h2>Transparent pricing</h2>
      <p>We offer clear tiers so you can choose the level of support that fits your life. Pricing shown on the pricing page — includes an education-forward consent discussion about labs and interventions.</p>
      <div class="pricing-tiles">
        <div class="tile">Foundations — starting at <strong>$495</strong></div>
        <div class="tile">Deep Reset — starting at <strong>$1,750</strong></div>
        <div class="tile">Monthly — from <strong>$180/mo</strong></div>
      </div>
      <a class="btn ghost" href="/pricing.html">Full Price List</a>
    </section>

    <!-- TESTIMONIALS -->
    <section class="testimonials wrap">
      <h2>What people say</h2>
      <div class="grid testimonials-grid">
        <blockquote class="quote">
          "I finally have a practical rhythm I can stick with — and my sleep improved. The plan was realistic and kind." — A client in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}
        </blockquote>
        <blockquote class="quote">
          "The education around labs made me feel informed; I appreciated the clear options and gentle pacing." — Another client
        </blockquote>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <section class="final-cta">
      <div class="wrap cta-grid">
        <div>
          <h2>Ready for a steady, sensible start?</h2>
          <p>Book a focused intake with {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}} — we’ll listen first, then build a plan together.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="cta-actions">
          <a class="btn primary" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
          <a class="btn ghost" href="/contact.html">Contact: {{EMAIL}}</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="foot-left">
        <strong>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</strong>
        <p>{{TAGLINE}}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="foot-right">
        <p>Phone: <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a></p>
        <p>Email: <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script src="assets/js/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>"} 
